    "reading": "Not re-conditioning costs about 22 to 27 percentage points once a clause has run 4 s or more: the clause-start head falls to roughly 24-30% accuracy while the conditional head holds near 47-57%. The cost of never updating grows monotonically with elapsed time, which is exactly the proposed mechanism. It is simply not yet visible at the rung that was declared primary."
  },
