  "design_error_owned": "The primary rung was chosen on action-utility grounds -- median remaining duration about 2 s, roughly a fifth of clauses surviving -- rather than on where the mechanism could be detected. That was the wrong basis. Rungs 2000 and 8000 ms pass in both orientations and 4000 ms fails, but these are pre-declared SECONDARY evidence and the frozen criterion forbids treating them as the verdict. Moving the primary rung now would be selecting the rung that favours the candidate.",
